cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you cite a reproduction ReplicHAI produced, cite the software too, with
  the version and method digest recorded in that reproduction's
  replication.json.
type: software
title: ReplicHAI
abstract: >-
  ReplicHAI audits the reproducibility of research papers whose findings rest
  on human participants. It finds what the authors released, separates the
  part of the work a machine can re-run from the part that needs people,
  implements and runs the machine-runnable part, records every decision the
  paper left unwritten, and returns a per-component verdict with its evidence.
authors:
  - name: Latere AI
    website: https://latere.ai
repository-code: https://github.com/latere-ai/replichai
url: https://replichai.latere.ai
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.30.3
date-released: 2026-10-08
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - replication
  - research software
  - human-computer interaction
  - AI agents
